<title>USA: Penn Traffic Dec sales down 8.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Penn Traffic Dec sales down 8.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Penn Traffic Co said on Tuesday that comparable store sales fell 8.5 percent in the month of December.</p>
<p>The company confirmed earlier reports by Wall Street analysts of the December decline in store sales.</p>
<p>A company spokesman was responding to an inquiry from Reuters.</p>
<p>(( - Caryn Trokie 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
